    "teaching_objectives": {
      "knowledge_objectives": [
        "Understand the definition and structure of complex numbers in rectangular form a + bi",
        "Identify the real part, imaginary part, and imaginary unit i of a complex number",
        "Comprehend the concept of the complex plane (Argand diagram)",
        "Master the conversion between rectangular form and polar form of complex numbers",
        "Understand the modulus r and argument θ in polar form",
        "Learn to express complex numbers in r(cos θ + i sin θ) and r·e^(iθ) forms"
